            <ArticleTitle>Mesonephric remnant with tubular function in a 15-year-old female.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2293-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jpedsurg.2008.08.029</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Congenital abnormalities of the genital or urinary tract are not uncommon and often occur together. This article discusses a unique case in which a functioning mesonephric remnant was found.</AbstractText>
